{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not inspect input when collection is disabled**\n\nEven with `content.input(false)`, this traverses the input through Jackson before the handler. Large inputs still incur allocation, and custom payload getters can have side effects that change handler behavior. Check `includeInput` before snapshotting and add a disabled-input test with a side-effecting payload.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sv4-a","finding_digest":"f74add3470e39517380d2850cc17c0f303247036b98764326c11164511677391","finding_id":"arf_v1_65fn2ndq4okrooanfbimyf6a6m","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationstart::excluded-input-no-touch","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationstart::excluded-input-no-touch","line":120,"observation_digest":"09c8d0d0f7faf0bcfb4c1c5dc258ea6eb589e448704c1ac02c44cee55a218f70","observation_id":"aro_v1_bhenbuhx7lylz62mdro4ewhkn2","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_65fn2ndq4okrooanfbimyf6a6m","published_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:10Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gaza4v2hy7owxqmfaj7d3xtx4q","reviewed_base_sha":"686c447b61d148228285e1d3e9c07d0b3b0358b1","reviewed_head_sha":"661ff218518770f142c359f81bc08e3d93bc5a7d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":120,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_hzg73ryhxildghizlv4mpa3lis","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:10Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
